title:First_Scene_01
---
Rigel:Everyone,Keep pushing,we are closing to the fort. #line:0ace70b 
Meissa:Rigel,can you hear me? #line:00ffdeb 
Rigel:Yes,Captain. #line:0836570 
Meissa:Me and Bear are moving close to the fort.ETA in 10 minutes. #line:0adcd27 
Meissa:Enemy's fire power is stronger on your side,so proceed with caution. #line:07e3434 
Rigel:Roger that. #line:0b1a722 
Rigel:Let's move to the coordination. #line:0f8bd3a 
===

title:First_Scene_02
---
Meissa:(Scream and Gunfire) #line:027ca48 
Meissa:something is not right here,we have been sent to the trap! #line:0257536 
Meissa:We are being ambushed,Rigel,don't go to that coordination!I repeat... #line:0024c73 
Rigel:Captain,you are okay? #line:047220b 
Rigel:Captain! #line:02e22e1 
Rigel:We have to save him! #line:03315d7 
Soilder A:This is suicide,we have to retreat! #line:08b78f2 
Soilder B:We didn't rest since last night.I can't.., #line:03f1285 
Rigel:This is an order!Captain always treats you well,this is how you repay him? #line:080b210 
Soilder A:But... #line:099bdf4 
Rigel:I said,this is an ORDER.Follow me. #line:0463ef4 
===

title:Intro_CinderTail
---
CinderTail:Finally,you came. #line:0a7bd1e 
Rigel:Captain?Captain!! #line:04cbda1 
Captain:Run...Rigel... #line:08d2dd7 
CinderTail:Looks like your Captain's life maintanence system is failing. #line:0f092f9 
CinderTail:His lung is broken and oxygen is running out.5 minutes.If you can beat me in 5 minutes,maybe your captain will live. #line:06d304b 
CinderTail:Or you can walk away now,I will pretend nothing happened. #line:00b20d3 
Rigel:Captain!!Arhhhhhhhhh!!!! #line:06da880 
Captain:Run... #line:05db81a 
CinderTail:Calm down,little mouse,anger can solve nothing. #line:0512258 
CinderTail:Let's dance. #line:000c3ce 
===

title:First_Scene_04
---
