CinderTail:You almost got me,little mouse.Almost. #line:035567d 
CinderTail:Looks like there are valuable implants in you. #line:09e0fd1 
CinderTail:Preparing for a throughal autopsy,little mouse,hehehe.... #line:0d83ae0 
